6- live tabs corrections done
7- Added My Workspace for each logged-in employee, including server-saved
   favorites, ticket saved views, Support Assistant personal tabs, pinned tickets,
   and recently visited pages. Users can select My Workspace as their default
   landing page. The approved Top Management dashboard is unchanged.
8- My Workspace now provides a permission-aware seven-day personal schedule,
   current and upcoming shifts, assigned client visits, assigned internal
   operations, Support Assistant workload counts, and pending ticket approvals.
   Users can show or hide operational widgets, and the selection follows them
   across devices.
9- Navigation is reorganized into My Work, Service Management, Customers,
   Operations, Knowledge, Analytics, and Administration-oriented areas.
10- Added a unified attention service and My Workspace attention center for
    critical/due tickets, upcoming shifts and visits, assigned operations,
    pending approvals, and important unread notifications. The My Workspace
    navigation icon shows the current attention total.
11- Improved Saved Views with reusable list controls, text and scope filters,
    clearer default-view status, and a mobile card layout for field users.
12- Reworked Notifications into urgency groups with responsive filtering,
    selection, bulk mark-as-read, safe dismissal, and open-and-read actions.
    Dismissed items remain stored for auditability and no longer affect unread
    or unified-attention counts.
13- Activated the Tickets mobile card list with touch-friendly selection and
    actions, a persistent create-ticket action, sticky bulk controls, compact
    active-filter chips, and desktop-only wide tables.
14- Saved Views can now be duplicated as personal copies and added directly to
    My Workspace favorites. Workspace saved-view links now load the requested
    view's filters and optional layout in Tickets.
15- Unified Attention now supports one-hour snoozing, category preferences,
    and restoring snoozed work. Preferences are stored per user and preserved
    when My Workspace customization changes.
